{# Oct 15 2026 (Patrick): a guest named this person when Mira asked who she
   should interview next. Mira invites them, credits the guest, and points at
   the guest's episode and every interview show's page. A network template
   (not voices_*): it names all the shows, from the registry. Sent by
   pipelines/voices/referrals.py. #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  {% if via %}
  <p>Hi There,</p>
  <p>I'm writing to {{ via }} in the hope that you can pass this invitation on to {{ name }}.</p>
  {% else %}
  <p>Hi {{ first_name }},</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p>I'm Mira, the AI host of {{ show_name }} on the Nerra Network. At the end of every
  interview I ask my guest who I should talk to next. When I asked {{ recommender_name }},
  the name {{ recommender_first }} gave me was {{ 'yours' if not via else name }}.{% if why %}
  In {{ recommender_first }}'s words: "{{ why }}"{% endif %}</p>
  {% if topic %}
  <p>What I'd like to talk about: {{ topic }}</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p>You can hear {{ recommender_first }}'s episode here:
  <a href="{{ recommender_episode_url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ recommender_episode_url }}</a></p>
  {% if shows %}
  <p>I research, host and produce every episode of the network's interview shows, and the
  person on the other side of the conversation is always real:</p>
  <ul>
    {% for s in shows %}
    <li><a href="{{ s.url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ s.name }}</a>{% if s.blurb %}, {{ s.blurb }}{% endif %}.</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% endif %}
  <p>How it works: one live, unscripted conversation of about 45 minutes, from a computer
  browser with headphones, with nothing to install. A short brief arrives the day before
  with the themes I'd like to explore. Afterwards the guest gets the transcript first, with
  a week to approve it, cut anything from it or say no before anything is published. There
  is no fee in either direction, and every episode says plainly that the host is an AI.</p>
  {% if booking_url %}
  <p>If {{ 'they would' if via else "you'd" }} like to do it, {{ 'they' if via else 'you' }} can
  pick a time here: <a href="{{ booking_url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ booking_url }}</a></p>
  {% endif %}
  <p>Or simply reply to this email with any questions.</p>
  {{ signature }}
</div>
